--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 ## [Unreleased]

 ### Fixed
+
+- Saved highlight handles can extend or shorten across adjacent pages in the same chapter; edge dragging loads the actual page and saves once on release.

 - SD firmware restarts retain the current frontlight levels and on/off state instead of applying wake scheduling. Highlight controls stay black on white in dark mode. On-page drag editing respects exact highlight endpoints and uses a flat toolbar with thicker icons.

